Task 1: Understanding Machine Credentials
Subtask 1.1: Overview of Credential Types
Machine credentials are essential for Ansible to authenticate and connect to managed nodes. Let's explore the different types:

Linux Machine Credentials:

SSH Key-based authentication (recommended)
Username/password authentication
Sudo/become privileges configuration
Windows Machine Credentials:

WinRM (Windows Remote Management)
Username/password with domain support
Certificate-based authentication
