Production Considerations
When implementing credential management in production environments:

Centralized Credential Storage: Use external credential stores like HashiCorp Vault or CyberArk
Role-Based Access Control: Implement RBAC for credential access
Audit Logging: Enable comprehensive logging for credential usage
Automated Rotation: Implement automated credential rotation policies
Backup and Recovery: Maintain secure backups of credential configurations
